-- Purpose: Controls the UI, display, and client-side interactions for the Rare Car Shop.
-- Runs on: Client
-- Location: StarterPlayerScripts
-- Dependencies: ReplicatedStorage.CarStats, ReplicatedStorage.ShopFrontendKit
-- Public API: None (Event-driven)
-- Networking: Listens to OpenRareShop, RareShopUpdate. Invokes GetRareShopState, BuyRareCar.
-- Security: UI debounces to prevent spam. Server acts as absolute authority for stock and funds.
-- Performance: Blur and UI hiding optimized. O(1) dictionary lookups for products.
-- Notes: Timer upgraded to HH:MM:SS format for 1hr+ restock intervals.

